# What a Forge image never needs: run outputs, the blind evaluation sets, the
# exo-arm build, git history and caches. Only packages/, examples/, schemas/,
# tests/, Makefile and pyproject.toml are copied in (see the Dockerfile).
.git
eval
runs
exo_arm
validation
fixtures
docs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.egg-info
packages/*.egg-info
build
